WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
05:50 — Morning walk log. Before fajr traffic, Khalid logs a 25-minute walk on his iPhone with large text — slow is still training, and the doctor’s clearance lives in the note.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
16:00 — Light session plan. Afternoon iPad shows today’s light weights clearly enough that he does not need his son to interpret tiny labels at the gym.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
16:40 — Sets done. Phone logger for two machines only; he finishes, drinks water, and leaves without chasing a streak or a personal record.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
20:10 — Son checks in. When his son visits they open the laptop together and skim the week at a glance — walks logged, light days honest, nothing performative.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
20:40 — Tomorrow ready. Phone reminder set for tomorrow’s walk. He locks the screen feeling capable, not behind.

